WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.081 --> 00:00:14.823
looked up as he clung to the rope.

2
00:00:14.843 --> 00:00:16.044
"What's going on?"

3
00:00:16.404 --> 00:00:16.924
he thought.

4
00:00:17.605 --> 00:00:20.808
Then he spotted Serena crossing the field with Winnie.

5
00:00:20.828 --> 00:00:25.632
"Whoa." A few monsters started whispering.

6
00:00:25.652 --> 00:00:28.234
"Who's that beautiful witch?"

7
00:00:28.254 --> 00:00:30.716
"Hi, Serena!"

8
00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:32.945
Pixel called, waving madly.

9
00:00:32.965 --> 00:00:39.290
"I—oops!" As soon as Pixel dropped the rope, Zork seized the opportunity.

10
00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:41.111
"Pull, Team Orange!"

11
00:00:41.571 --> 00:00:42.192
he shouted.

12
00:00:45.214 --> 00:00:49.096
Before Ben could react, he felt the rope slip through his hands.

13
00:00:49.837 --> 00:00:54.940
A second later Mog landed in the mud pit, splattering mud everywhere.

14
00:00:55.420 --> 00:00:59.583
Pixel fell in next, followed by Deb, Ben, and finally Jen.

15
00:01:01.024 --> 00:01:03.145
Team Orange laughed and cheered.

16
00:01:05.706 --> 00:01:09.588
Their fans went wild too, chanting, "Orange!

17
00:01:10.168 --> 00:01:13.890
Orange!" "One point for Team Orange!"

18
00:01:14.370 --> 00:01:15.550
Mr. Gwarg declared.

19
00:01:21.853 --> 00:01:24.274
Team Black pulled themselves out of the mud.

20
00:01:25.134 --> 00:01:28.496
Mog looked disappointed, but he tried to shake it off.

21
00:01:29.244 --> 00:01:31.065
"Okay, Team Black, good effort.

22
00:01:31.485 --> 00:01:34.767
But if we want to win, we're going to need more focus."

23
00:01:36.128 --> 00:01:38.689
"Sorry, everybody," Pixel mumbled.

24
00:01:38.709 --> 00:01:43.632
"I got distracted by, um, somebody."

25
00:01:45.793 --> 00:01:49.575
Mr. Freaky was racing around, waving his arms happily.

26
00:01:49.595 --> 00:01:52.537
"What an exciting start to Field Day!

27
00:01:53.077 --> 00:01:56.559
Get cleaned up, Team Black, and we'll move on to the next event."

28
00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:02.781
Ben wiped himself down as best he could.

29
00:02:04.222 --> 00:02:06.022
Then he went over to talk to Gaby.

30
00:02:06.043 --> 00:02:08.284
"Nice win," he said.

31
00:02:08.304 --> 00:02:10.565
"I sure wish you were on our team, though."

32
00:02:11.545 --> 00:02:12.145
"Me too."

33
00:02:12.966 --> 00:02:14.786
Gaby folded her arms and scowled.

34
00:02:14.806 --> 00:02:19.268
"But Mog—and Waldo—never asked me to be on Team Black."

35
00:02:19.288 --> 00:02:22.330
"I should have thought of asking you," Ben said.

36
00:02:22.350 --> 00:02:24.291
"But I was worried about Winnie yesterday.

37
00:02:24.671 --> 00:02:27.052
She seems so bothered by her cousin or something."

38
00:02:27.772 --> 00:02:30.774
"I think Winnie is jealous of Serena," Gaby said.

39
00:02:30.794 --> 00:02:32.995
"Which is dumb, if you ask me.

40
00:02:33.595 --> 00:02:37.118
Serena's beautiful, but Winnie's really pretty too."

41
00:02:37.858 --> 00:02:38.578
Ben nodded.

42
00:02:38.598 --> 00:02:39.759
"I know."

43
00:02:39.779 --> 00:02:44.422
"She's even letting it get in the way of Field Day," Gaby went on.

44
00:02:44.442 --> 00:02:50.945
"Zork asked her to join Team Orange, but she told him she was too busy with her cousin."

45
00:02:51.826 --> 00:02:54.347
At the mention of Zork, Ben just grunted.

46
00:02:56.044 --> 00:02:57.885
"Well, good luck with the sack race, Gaby.

47
00:02:58.306 --> 00:02:59.927
It should be another good competition."

48
00:03:02.148 --> 00:03:05.290
A few minutes later, the two teams stood with Mr.

49
00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:07.512
Gwarg near a white line on the field.

50
00:03:07.532 --> 00:03:13.376
"This is the starting line for the sack race," the gym teacher explained.

51
00:03:13.396 --> 00:03:18.879
"And remember, there is absolutely no floating or flying in this event.

52
00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:24.483
Your feet must stay in the bag, and you must hop to the finish line.

53
00:03:25.023 --> 00:03:25.604
Got it?"

54
00:03:26.168 --> 00:03:28.609
"Got it," all the monsters replied.

55
00:03:28.629 --> 00:03:33.052
"In the first heat, three members from each team will race.

56
00:03:33.812 --> 00:03:36.774
Then the other three members will take a turn.

57
00:03:37.594 --> 00:03:42.457
The top two finishers from each team will go on to the final round.

58
00:03:43.138 --> 00:03:45.799
Now find your sacks, hoppers!"

59
00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:52.163
Brunhilda, Carly, and Gaby climbed into their sacks for Team Orange.

60
00:03:52.643 --> 00:03:57.097
Pixel, Mog, and Waldo were going to be Team Black's first hoppers.

61
00:03:57.117 --> 00:04:00.258
"Hop as fast as you can!"

62
00:04:00.658 --> 00:04:01.339
Mog said.

63
00:04:01.359 --> 00:04:04.600
"Aye-aye, Captain," Pixel and Waldo said.

64
00:04:05.380 --> 00:04:07.061
Mr. Gwarg raised his whistle.

65
00:04:07.081 --> 00:04:11.823
"Ready set Tweet!

66
00:04:12.343 --> 00:04:18.526
As Gaby took off, her long legs immediately got caught in the sack, and she toppled forward onto

67
00:04:18.566 --> 00:04:19.086
her face.

68
00:04:19.106 --> 00:04:21.327
"Oof!" "Get up, Gaby!"

69
00:04:21.687 --> 00:04:22.387
Zork yelled.

70
00:04:22.407 --> 00:04:23.968
"Don't just lie there!"

71
00:04:24.672 --> 00:04:27.976
Gaby tried to get up, but she got even more tangled.

72
00:04:28.456 --> 00:04:31.680
Brunhilda had been laughing as she hopped past Gaby.

73
00:04:33.923 --> 00:04:36.826
But a second later, she plunged forward too.

74
00:04:37.426 --> 00:04:40.330
Ben held his breath, watching his teammates.

75
00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:45.495
Mog seemed focused only on the finish line as he hopped across the field.

76
00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:52.563
Waldo wasn't too far behind Mog, but he kept having to stop to push his glasses up on

77
00:04:52.623 --> 00:04:53.164
his nose.

78
00:04:54.104 --> 00:04:58.066
Meanwhile Pixel looked as if he was drowning inside his sack.

79
00:04:58.627 --> 00:05:00.968
It was much too large for the tiny ghost.

80
00:05:00.988 --> 00:05:02.549
"Go, Team Black!"

81
00:05:02.849 --> 00:05:03.569
Ben shouted.

82
00:05:03.589 --> 00:05:05.951
"Feet, do your stuff!"

83
00:05:06.351 --> 00:05:07.772
Carly called out suddenly.

84
00:05:09.573 --> 00:05:12.454
Then she began leaping forward with huge hops.

85
00:05:12.474 --> 00:05:15.136
"Uh-oh," Ben thought.

86
00:05:15.772 --> 00:05:18.033
Carly was rapidly catching up to Mog!

87
00:05:18.053 --> 00:05:20.433
"Go, Mog, go!"

88
00:05:20.653 --> 00:05:21.374
Ben shouted.

89
00:05:21.894 --> 00:05:23.414
The racers kept going.

90
00:05:33.097 --> 00:05:37.798
Mog dived for the finish line just as Carly took one last enormous leap.

91
00:05:38.298 --> 00:05:41.459
Mr. Gwarg had crouched down to watch the finish line.

92
00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:45.320
He stood back up.

93
00:05:46.684 --> 00:05:51.346
"And the winner is Mog!"

94
00:05:51.366 --> 00:05:54.587
"What?" Mog was still lying on the ground.

95
00:05:54.607 --> 00:05:56.428
"You won.

96
00:05:56.828 --> 00:06:00.069
Carly is the second-place winner," Mr.

97
00:06:00.109 --> 00:06:00.790
Gwarg said.

98
00:06:00.810 --> 00:06:04.651
"Rats!" Carly cried, stepping out of her sack.

99
00:06:05.372 --> 00:06:06.592
The crowd gasped.

100
00:06:08.333 --> 00:06:12.274
In place of her normal feet, Carly had huge kangaroo feet.

101
00:06:12.294 --> 00:06:14.495
"Hey! No fair!"

102
00:06:15.015 --> 00:06:15.936
a goblin yelled.

103
00:06:16.852 --> 00:06:19.233
Team Black was complaining loudly too.

104
00:06:20.013 --> 00:06:21.574
Mog pointed at Carly's feet.

105
00:06:21.594 --> 00:06:23.895
"She used magic!"

106
00:06:24.955 --> 00:06:27.516
Carly grinned and stuck out her tongue at him.

107
00:06:27.536 --> 00:06:28.757
"No, I didn't.

108
00:06:29.177 --> 00:06:31.358
It's not magic—it's an ability.

109
00:06:31.938 --> 00:06:33.959
Remember? I'm a doppelganger.

110
00:06:34.279 --> 00:06:36.180
And doppelgangers can change shape."

111
00:06:41.582 --> 00:06:42.582
Deb scowled.

112
00:06:42.602 --> 00:06:46.084
"Two can play this game," she muttered.
